      "created_at": "2013-02-18T18:08:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Embolden - Ongoing</p><p>\"Play this card next to a hero character card... At the end of that hero's turn, either fanatic deals them 2 radiant damage or destroy this card\"</p><p>I'm under the impression that embolden only deals 2 radiant damage to the hero character card that it is attached to but it seems the word \"them\" suggests that there may be an instance (that I don't know about) where it can deal 2 radiant damage to more than one hero? In that case, should the \"them\" be a \"him or her or it\"?</p><p>Thanks for the clarification!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:26.796Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
