      "raw": "<p>Embolden - Ongoing</p><p>&quot;Play this card next to a hero character card... At the end of that hero&#39;s turn, either fanatic deals them 2 radiant damage or destroy this card&quot;</p><p>I&#39;m under the impression that embolden only deals 2 radiant damage to the hero character card that it is attached to but it seems the word &quot;them&quot; suggests that there may be an instance (that I don&#39;t know about) where it can deal 2 radiant damage to more than one hero? In that case, should the &quot;them&quot; be a &quot;him or her or it&quot;?</p><p>Thanks for the clarification!</p>",
