    {
      "id": 53192,
      "name": "Sefirit",
      "username": "Sefirit",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-19T15:48:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Speaking about Embolden, what happens if it is played on Wraith and she has Combat Stance out (or Ra with Flame Barrier)?&nbsp; When Fanatic deals Wratih 2 radiant damage does Wratih HAVE TO deal fanatic 2 melee damage?&nbsp; Can the player opt out of this kind of thing or is it just a bad idea to Embolden someone with a counter attack?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:18.597Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
