      "raw": "[quote=\"j1hopki1\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Cosmonaut Zero wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">If you know something has gender but don&#39;t know what that &nbsp;gender is, &quot;they&quot; is an appropriate usage.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nIf you know Omnitron-X does not have a gender, is &quot;they&quot; still appropriate?\n\n[/quote]\n\nYes.&nbsp; The singular &quot;they&quot; is all-inclusive.&nbsp; (The plural is &quot;all them&quot;.)\n",
